The content is condensed and adapted from "GenAI Patterns" (Draft, 2026) by
Sangam Pandey (https://genaipatterns.dev), licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0.

Changes: the book text is condensed and paraphrased into reference files; additions
not in the book are marked "Beyond the book"; the book's code snippets are rewritten
and extended, and new examples are written for patterns the book has no code for.

